        "note": "The 19,628-row expected output at `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`: monthID, dayID and hourID NULL, the one Whole Year cell scaled by its 365/7 weeks (AggregationSQLGenerator's convertWeeks). The model emits it from `mos_*` (`n_outputSumsDays` and `n_outputSumsMonths` 1). Evaporative permeation has NO rows: TankTemperatureGenerator writes no AverageTankTemperature under the collapse (PLAN.md §7.3.64).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
